  "paper_id": "ccs-2023-phoenix-detect-and-locate-resilience-issues-in-blockchai-bdb208c5",
  "title": "Phoenix: Detect and Locate Resilience Issues in Blockchain via Context-Sensitive Chaos",
  "abstract": "Resilience is vital to blockchain systems and helps them automatically adapt and continue providing their service when adverse situations occur, e.g., node crashing and data discarding. However, due to the vulnerabilities in their implementation, blockchain systems may fail to recover from the error situations, resulting in permanent service disruptions. Such vulnerabilities are called resilience issues.",
